# Licence of the model weights (`model.npz`)

Copyright 2026 Richard (khmer-transliterator project).

The model weights of en-km-phonetic-transliterator (`model.npz`) are licensed under the **Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)**:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode.en

In short, the legal code is what applies:
- **Attribution:** give credit to the licensor and the upstream sources (the "Data attribution" section of the model card), link the licence and say
  whether you made changes.
- **NonCommercial:** no use primarily intended for commercial advantage or monetary compensation.
- **ShareAlike:** if you share adaptations of the weights, share them under the same licence.

The package code that runs the model is licensed separately, under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 (`LICENSE` in the
package).

Upstream data notices that apply in addition are in the model card's "Data attribution" section, including the FineWeb-2 ODC-By notice and the
Khmer Wikipedia CC BY-SA attribution.
